      {
        "text": "Only the list of running programs, without their data",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It holds the whole memory."
      },
      {
        "text": "Only the disk, as the guest was running",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Running means memory too."
      },
      {
        "text": "Disk and memory",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right. It resumes mid-flight."
